{"4906360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Next Room", "steam_appid": 4906360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4915080], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️<strong>The Next Room - Every room is a test.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚪Every door hides a new nightmare. Every room could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚠️WARNING: This game contains flashing lights, intense combat, and fast-paced action that may not be suitable for players with photosensitive epilepsy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Next Room is a fast-paced 3D action roguelite where every room is a new challenge and every decision can mean the difference between survival and death. Fight your way through relentless monsters, avoid deadly traps, uncover hidden secrets, and defeat powerful bosses guarding the path ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same. Experiment with different builds, discover rare equipment, craft stronger gear, and adapt your strategy as you venture deeper into the unknown. Will you spend your hard-earned gold in the shop, search for hidden rooms, or save your resources for the battles yet to come? Only those who keep moving will discover what lies behind... the next room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎯<u>Gameplay Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤺<strong><i>Battle through rooms filled with dangerous enemies.</i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906360/extras/2d614fbddab98e526526e05db7fc6434.poster.avif?t=1787156576\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906360/extras/2d614fbddab98e526526e05db7fc6434.webm?t=1787156576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s