y as you venture deeper into the unknown. Will you spend your hard-earned gold in the shop, search for hidden rooms, or save your resources for the battles yet to come? Only those who keep moving will discover what lies behind... the next room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎯<u>Gameplay Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤺<strong><i>Battle through rooms filled with dangerous enemies.</i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906360/extras/2d614fbddab98e526526e05db7fc6434.poster.avif?t=1787156576\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906360/extras/2d614fbddab98e526526e05db7fc6434.webm?t=1787156576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906360/extras/2d614fbddab98e526526e05db7fc6434.mp4?t=1787156576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👹<strong><i>Face challenging bosses with unique abilities and attack patterns.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906360/extras/c373f87c3cdedc8f343622a00c571119.poster.avif?t=1787156576\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906360/extras/c373f87c3cdedc8f343622a00c571119.webm?t=1787156576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4906360/extras/c373f87c3cdedc8f343622a00c571119.mp4?t=1787156576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️<strong><i>Craft and upgrade your equipment to create power